# Actor kind $86's wait (ActorKind86Wait $83:9303, Kind86WaitWork $84:9766):
# the pairs placed on stage a5 s0 at x $09A0 and $0A20 (a placed one, $07
# 0, and its child, $07 4, $2B above it) that drop and rise again. Play
# from the stage's start never comes this far. The view put at x $0920,
# y $0080 and Aladdin at x $09A0: the placements there start both pairs.
# A. Aladdin held at y $0150 under the first while it drops: its zone ($5C)
# hurts him (ActorZoneHurtsPlayerLong, $83:873F, C clear: $4A = 1).
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a5_s0.state
wait 30
poke 001773 20,09
poke 0019E5 20,09
poke 001777 80,00
poke 0019E9 80,00
poke 0008E7 A0,09
poke 0008EA E0,00
wait 60
repeat 120
poke 0008EA 50,01
wait 1
end
wait 30
# B. As A without the hurt, then the view and Aladdin put at x $0400:
# out of its range ($84:97EE), the placed one frees its child
# (ActorFreePlacedAtYLong) and sets its state bits $8C.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a5_s0.state
wait 30
poke 001773 20,09
poke 0019E5 20,09
poke 001777 80,00
poke 0019E9 80,00
poke 0008E7 A0,09
poke 0008EA E0,00
wait 75
poke 001773 00,04
poke 0019E5 00,04
poke 0008E7 40,04
wait 10
